	(text "OF THE 32 I/O ADDRESSES SELECTED\nBY J2, J4, J3 THEN J5 SELECTS\nADDRESS BLOCKS OF 4 I/O ADDRESSES\nSELECT 1 FOR THE CTC AND 1 FOR THE RTC\n\nWIRE JUMPERS CAN BREAK THE LIMITS\nPLACED BY STRAIGHT ACROSS JUMPERS"
